# Agent Memory Kit codex ignore template.
# Place at project root as .codexignore when your Codex runtime or hooks support it.
# If native support is unavailable, treat this file as a policy artifact and mirror critical
# patterns in hooks, scope guards, .gitignore, .cursorignore, or agent instructions.

# Git internals
.git/

# OS / desktop metadata
**/desktop.ini
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Python caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

# Node / frontend deps
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Logs / temp
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# Local env / secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*secret*
**/*secrets*
**/*credential*
**/*credentials*

# Large/generated data
**/downloads/
**/artifacts/
**/cache/

